.²1 To pass over or by, cross (as a place <ab>&c.</ab>). {#upAsate puruzaM ye hyakAmAste#}
 {#Sukametadativartanti DIrAH#} <ls>Muṇḍ. 3. 2. 1</ls>.
.²2
